"""
Admin API for the installation-wide personal access tokens (PATs).

A PAT authenticates the OpenAI-compatible API (``/api/v1/...``): it is not tied
to a user and it declares which profiles (models) it can reach. The token
secret is shown exactly once, by ``POST /api/api-tokens``.

    GET    /api/api-tokens            - list the tokens (no secrets)
    GET    /api/api-tokens/profiles   - profiles that can be granted
    POST   /api/api-tokens            - create (secret returned once)
    PATCH  /api/api-tokens/{id}       - rename / re-grant profiles / disable
    DELETE /api/api-tokens/{id}       - revoke

Every endpoint requires an admin session. See
``docs/openai-compatible-api.md`` for the client setup.

Made with ❤️ by codx-junior
"""

